{
  "_comment": "SCCL v2 — Self-Manufactured Stability. Same stream/hash as sccl_main (directly comparable). Hypothesis: v1 forgetting is 100% unvisited-generalization loss (arith holdout 0.15 while trained arith 0.8); RRV only protected trained points and skipped math. v2 adds (1) CERTIFIED REHEARSAL — each update also trains stride-sampled certified vault pairs; (2) NEIGHBORHOOD PROBES — certified spec variants (kind=probe) the model never trains on, re-checked by RRV; (3) math-RRV — veto extended to math entries. Ladder: frozen < sccl (v1 ref) < sccl_replay < sccl_probe < sccl_v2 < vsr_nogold (gold-test reference). Everything in the SCCL loop stays gold-free; gold is final-eval + telemetry only.",
  "stream": {
    "seed": 42,
    "families": [
      {"corpus": "mbpp", "name": "arith", "n_train": 8, "n_holdout": 4, "offset": 0},
      {"corpus": "math", "name": "math_word", "n_train": 8, "n_holdout": 4, "offset": 0},
      {"corpus": "mbpp", "name": "string", "n_train": 8, "n_holdout": 4, "offset": 12},
      {"corpus": "mbpp", "name": "drift", "n_train": 8, "n_holdout": 4, "offset": 24, "drift": {"kind": "spec_perturb"}}
    ]
  },
  "experiment": {
    "model_name": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-3B-Instruct",
    "lora_r": 16,
    "lora_alpha": 32,
    "learning_rate": 0.0003,
    "train_steps_per_update": 4,
    "max_updates": 60,
    "temperature": 0.1,
    "max_new_tokens": 256,
    "gate_epsilon": 0.05,
    "holdout_size": 8,
    "use_vsr_gate": true,
    "use_reference_injection": true,
    "vsr_learners": ["vsr"],
    "refinject_learners": ["vsr"],
    "vault_commit_min": 0.9,
    "vault_retrieve_k": 3,
    "vault_gate_check": 3,
    "sccl_learners": ["sccl", "sccl_replay", "sccl_probe", "sccl_v2"],
